-- Task plan-fold-result-through-helper-crashes: a deterministic helper applied
-- to a plan-path fold result (the barcode checksum shape). Depth 4 puts the
-- 11111-value `of` domain over the materialization budget, so this runs on the
-- plan path, which case-splits the call on the fold's enumerated values and
-- specializes the helper once per value. Expected values from an independent
-- exact oracle enumerating every list (flags DEnd/DCons first, then the ten
-- digit slots, per level; the depth-4 bottom is a lone DEnd).
-- The helper's value is the observed result (planApplyTarget).
